      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BONNIE IS BOUJEE (2) missed the hat-trick last start when fourth and beaten 9 lengths (30.38) last time at Q Parklands. Has a good record here at this journey. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Has winning claims on her best figures. CHRISTMAS DAY (5) had been racing in honest fashion recording three placings in a row before finishing fourth (19.95) at this track latest. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings six times from nine attempts. Shapes as one to consider. LUCORA (8) won again in another strong performance after stalking the pace to make it two on the bounce, scoring by 1.5 lengths (25.65) at this track over 457m. Hard to fault his form and he makes plenty of appeal. BRUNSWICK ROCKET (7) is in the mix after placing here at this trip last time out.",
